    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.sf2e-anachronism.actions.Item.UeMHbnnaXDa3sGfG]{Transfer Vitality}.</p><p>The target's shadow darkens and swells, reducing bright light within a 10-foot emanation of the target to dim light. This is a form of magical darkness and can overcome non-magical light sources or attempt to counteract magical light. The target becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed} while in this dim light and can use the concealed condition to Hide. This lasts until the end of your next turn.</p>",
